{
  "name": "魔能爪刺青 Eldritch Claw Tattoo",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/tools/scribal/burnisher-tooth.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\">覆盖区域：半条肢体或一整块头皮</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">这个绘有爪型或其他锯齿型图案的刺</span><span class=\"GramE\">青需要</span>用一根特殊的针制作。 <br><em><strong>刺青同调。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">同调此物品时，你需要将针持握，并抵在你想要让刺</span><span class=\"GramE\">青出现</span>的那处皮肤上。当同调完成时，针头会化为墨水再变成刺青。若你与刺青的同调结束，刺青会消失，针头会再次出现在你的位置中。<br><em><strong>魔法打击。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">只要该刺青在你的皮肤上，攻击对非魔法攻击具有抗性或免疫的目标时，你的徒手打击视为魔法攻击，并且你以徒手打击发动的攻击检定和伤害掷</span><span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>获得+1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">加值。</span> <br><span class=\"GramE\"><em><strong>魔能巨</strong></em></span><em><strong>锤。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">作为一个附赠动作，你可以增强刺青</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">分钟。持续时间内，你每次以武器或徒手打击发动近战攻击时，墨水触须会朝着对方喷射而去，使你可以触及距离你最远</span>15<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">尺的目标。此外，你的近战攻击命中时会造成额外</span>1d6<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">力场伤害。使用后，直到下次黎明前，此附赠动作不能再次使用。</span></p></div></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
